    "api_error_status": null,
    "result": "Perfect! The fix is working. Here's what I did:\n\n## Summary of the fix:\n\n**Problem:** The `frai gate init --ci` command was not passing the `--ci` flag to the `frai-gate` CLI, so the GitHub Actions workflow file (`.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`) wasn't being created.\n\n**Root cause:** The parent program had the `--ci` option defined, so Commander was parsing it at the main level instead of passing it through to the `gate` subcommand.\n\n**Solution:** I made two changes to `packages/frai-cli/src/index.ts`:\n\n1. **Line 603:** Added `.enablePositionalOptions(true)` to the main program to allow positional arguments before options are parsed.\n2. **Line 742:** Added `.passThroughOptions(true)` to the `gate` command to ensure all options (including `--ci`) are passed through to the frai-gate CLI without being consumed by Commander.\n\nThe package has been rebuilt and tested \u2014 `frai gate init --ci` now correctly creates both `FRAI-SPEC.md` and `.github/workflows/rai-gate.yml`.",
